# Dependencies — reinstalled fresh inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache

# VCS / editor
.git
.vscode
.DS_Store

# Build outputs — rebuilt inside the image
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/dist
**/.turbo
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets — never bake these into an image layer
.env
.env.*
*.pem

# Not needed at runtime
**/coverage
**/*.md
screenshots
todo.md
CLAUDE.md
.github